					"nextDialogs": [
						105011203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011203,
					"content": "That's not how you count it! Besides, Paimon hasn't even ordered yet!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011204,
					"content": "Squirrel Fish, Jueyun Chili Chicken, and Jewelry Soup, please!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011205,
					"content": "Sure. And is there anything else that you would like to order, ma'am?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuhua"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011206,
					"content": "I—I'd just like to ask, how much do the current dishes cost in total?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011207,
					"content": "Um, around twenty thousand Mora.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuhua"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011208,
					"content": "Then... Uh, I—I'll just have some vegetarian noodles, please.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011209,
					"content": "Alright. A bowl of vegetarian noodles, was it? Please wait a moment, we will serve you shortly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yuhua"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011210,
					"content": "Paimon's been thinking about something since we started eating...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011211,
					"content": "Why did she only order one dish?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105011212,
					"content": "Is it... because she actually doesn't have money?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011213,
					"content": "I heard that! I said I was treating. How could I be rattled by something as mundane as Mora!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011214,
					"content": "An astrologist's mind is set on studying the stars. Being so easily disturbed by such banal matters would hamper my judgment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011215,
					"content": "Especially the act of overly gratifying oneself using Mora. It is both vulgar...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011216,
					"content": "*stomach grumble*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011217,
					"content": "...and dangerous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011218,
					"content": "So not eating the dishes we ordered is also part of an astrologist's pride? Paimon doesn't get it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011219,
					"content": "But it feels kinda bad that only we got to feast...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011220,
					"content": "Let me whip something up for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105011221,
					"content": "Oh, yes! We can do that! Just give us a minute!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
